From a65e2b501932e3fbc8dfad8ab3e3ccde4bc2b78a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:45:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type wallet keypool lifecycle counters and display
 context

Migrate 16 wallet caller sites as one keypool/HD group. Copy the existing
bracketed storage display label once, retain Info and all text, and expose
signed added counts/indices, unsigned pool sizes and public seed ID hex.
No seed, private key, script or credential contents are newly captured.
All locking, key/database operations and notifications are unchanged.
Shared eCash wallet tier; keep before V2 wallet adaptations.

The existing converter only handles bare logging macros. A wallet-specific
AST caller adapter expands the two established prefix helpers solely for
the existing exact-message/severity validator, then replaces the concrete
caller. No logger/renderer API or generic converter changes are made.
The opaque facades remain while other callers are pending.

Scripted-diff commands (ast-grep-py==0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/wallet_callers.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/wallet-keypool-callers.json --report /private/tmp/wallet-keypool-source-proof.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/wallet/scriptpubkeyman.cpp

Keep the reviewed conversion recipe and source checks, without a permanent
per-conversion keypool schema fixture. The removed fixture primarily checked
replacement field/message spelling rather than independent behavior.
Rare failure and inactive-seed paths are not newly forced.

Source checks pass: 16 AST mappings, idempotent replay, 18 total typed-event
sites in this file, Ruff 0.15.8, reviewed diff and git diff --check.
SOURCE ONLY: NOT_COMPILED/NOT_RUN. Combined native validation follows
integration/initial benchmarks under a resource grant.
